  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born amidst the toxic runoff behind the old Snail Bikers hideout, 'Rotty' learned to survive by scavenging for discarded parts and mastering the virtual world through an old, jury-rigged console. He witnessed firsthand the brutal turf wars for DRIP, losing his flock to a raid, and now seeks vengeance and a stable connection to the metaverse.",
    "class": "Controller",
    "name": "Rotty Fang",
    "personality": "Brooding and cynical, Rotty masks his deep-seated loneliness with a sardonic wit. He's fiercely loyal to those who earn his trust, throwing himself into protecting them, often strategizing and playing support. He has a nervous tic, constantly fiddling with his controller even when he's not plugged in.",
